cuOpt SOCP portfolio, mu sequence step 1 (SEQ[1]), 8 identical cold solves.
Settings: barrier, augmented=1, IR=1, crossover off, tol=1e-8,
barrier_dual_initial_point=Automatic (resolves to SedumiMu on a cone model),
barrier_step_scale=0.9 (default). sequence_solve off, no cache reuse.

5 runs converge in 24-27 iterations and report Optimal.
3 runs break down at ~iteration 24 when the dual residual jumps from 1e-10
to 1e-07, run to 30-31 iterations, then hit 'Numerical error in objective',
restore an earlier iterate, and report 'Suboptimal solution found'.
All 8, including the suboptimal ones, return Optimal from
get_termination_reason() in the Python API.


